  "name": "Support Ticket Triage & Classifier — Auto-Route New Tickets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9fe761fb-b8cf-4041-b368-1cc733c76ae1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -368,
        16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Support Ticket Triage & Classifier — Auto-Route New Tickets\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives newly created support tickets through a webhook, normalizes the ticket text, and sends it to a RapidAPI-based triage service for classification. It then checks whether the returned priority is high or critical and routes the ticket into either an escalation path or a standard helpdesk update path. The final nodes are placeholders for notifying incident channels or updating a ticketing system.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the webhook URL in the source support system so new tickets trigger the workflow.\n- Set the normalization fields to match the incoming ticket payload, such as subject, description, requester, and ticket ID.\n- Add the required RapidAPI credentials and confirm the triage API endpoint, headers, and request body mapping are correct.\n- Replace the no-op destination nodes with real Slack, PagerDuty, Teams, Zendesk, Freshdesk, or Jira integrations as needed.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the IF condition to match the exact priority labels returned by the classifier, and customize the escalation alert or helpdesk update fields to fit your support process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4017895b-a09d-4cec-90aa-9280129e062b",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        192,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Receive and normalize ticket\n\nCaptures a newly created ticket from the webhook and prepares a normalized ticket text payload for downstream analysis."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "95950139-3798-4bcc-9ef5-4db208e30945",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        672,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Analyze and route priority\n\nSends the normalized ticket to the RapidAPI triage classifier, then branches based on whether the resulting priority is high or critical."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "69a76e9b-bb4b-47c9-b440-227d5717747c",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1152,
        16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Escalate urgent tickets\n\nBuilds an escalation alert for high-priority tickets and passes it to the placeholder notification step for Slack, PagerDuty, or Teams."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d6b3990d-2d27-4473-8b71-7805b638f407",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1152,
        368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Update standard tickets\n\nBuilds a standard helpdesk update for non-urgent tickets and passes it to the placeholder ticketing-system update step."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-ticket-created",
      "name": "When Ticket Created",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "support-ticket-triage-demo",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "new-support-ticket",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "onReceived"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "set-normalize-ticket",
      "name": "Normalize Ticket Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-ticket-text",
              "name": "ticket",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.ticket || $json.body?.description || $json.body?.comment || $json.ticket || '' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "http-analyze-ticket",
      "name": "Post to RapidAPI for Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://support-ticket-triage.p.rapidapi.com/analyze-ticket",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"ticket\": $json.ticket } }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-RapidAPI-Host",
              "value": "support-ticket-triage.p.rapidapi.com"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "RapidAPI Key"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "if-priority-route",
      "name": "Check Ticket Priority",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "or",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-critical",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.priority }}",
              "rightValue": "critical"
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-high",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.priority }}",
              "rightValue": "high"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "set-escalation-alert",
      "name": "Prepare Escalation Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1200,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-alert-text",
              "name": "alert_message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=🚨 [{{ $json.priority.toUpperCase() }}] {{ $json.one_line_summary }}\nTeam: {{ $json.suggested_team }} | SLA risk: {{ $json.sla_breach_risk }}\nSignals: {{ $json.urgency_signals.join(', ') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "noop-notify",
      "name": "Send Notification to Apps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        1440,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "set-standard-update",
      "name": "Prepare Standard Ticket Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1200,
        528
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-update-fields",
              "name": "helpdesk_update",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ { priority: $json.priority, category: $json.category, tags: $json.suggested_tags, team: $json.suggested_team, summary: $json.one_line_summary } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "noop-helpdesk",
      "name": "Update Helpdesk Systems",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        1440,
        528
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
